WOW-BG3 benilla patch 0094: effects keep BG3's colours while a new LUT is on its way.

BG3 re-renders its grading LUT as the light changes. A frame naming one not yet read fell to the plain
sRGB composite, which clips bright effects. The last usable pair now serves until the new one arrives.
Once a second, the log says why frames had no effects: an empty BG3 frame, a stale one or none picked.

